### Tone: End-of-game award: Bold Estimator, the furthest single miss of the game. $factor: how far off ("2 000×").
### Gentle: framed as boldness and ambition, a lab curiosity, never mockery of the person. Never mention dunce caps
### (an easter egg found elsewhere).

